id: pm-tknnzp
title: Preserve reviewed legacy merge receipts across SDK upgrades
description: GitHub 1446 reports that unchanged pm-beads receipts reviewed by older merge_reconcile events are gated again after upgrading from 2026.10.8 to 2026.10.9. The advertised dry-run cannot prove snapshots and omits the documented force-review recovery. Reproduce on immutable downstream data and determine the compatible settled-receipt and recovery contract without destructive receipt cleanup.
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-12T13:31:52.812Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-12T18:26:07.859Z"
assignee: "harness:codex"
claim_principal: "harness:codex#da6c4a524d0c5025cfe0e34b"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 240
acceptance_criteria: "Reproduce 2026.10.8, 2026.10.9 and current SDK against isolated exact downstream data; distinguish historical reviewed receipt proof from unreviewed decisions; preserve immutable evidence and unchanged bytes on refusals; any force review guidance names its audit requirements; independent regressions and all-source coverage pass."
parent: pm-atfm
risk: medium
confidence: medium
expected_result: Reviewed legacy receipts retain auditable settlement or have explicit safe migration guidance before a strict health gate changes.
