body: "Source: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1446. Public reproduction uses pm-beads main at 25561a2 and references prior issues 1200/1202 plus downstream workaround pm-beads PR 138. This is a reported upgrade behavior, not a verified current regression. Do not run force reconciliation on real downstream data during intake."
